1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:08,125
Some places are known for what they make. Yongkang is one of them.

2
00:00:08,785 --> 00:00:15,589
This county-level city is administered by Jinhua,
in central Zhejiang Province, eastern China.

3
00:00:15,899 --> 00:00:23,143
Here, hills, old neighborhoods, and a busy
manufacturing economy exist side by side.

4
00:00:23,803 --> 00:00:31,638
Yongkang's county history reaches back to the Three
Kingdoms period, more than seventeen hundred years ago.

5
00:00:32,298 --> 00:00:36,757
Today, Yongkang is often called China's hardware capital.

6
00:00:37,067 --> 00:00:43,777
Its factories produce goods such as power
tools, household doors, and kitchenware.

7
00:00:44,087 --> 00:00:50,322
These ordinary objects help connect this
city with everyday life far beyond Zhejiang.

8
00:00:50,982 --> 00:00:54,024
But industry is only part of the story.

9
00:00:54,334 --> 00:01:00,905
To understand a city, it helps to look at both
its workplaces and the places where people gather.

10
00:01:01,565 --> 00:01:08,113
At Fangyan, steep cliffs and striking rock
formations create a dramatic landscape.

11
00:01:08,423 --> 00:01:12,777
This scenic area is known for its Danxia landforms.

12
00:01:13,437 --> 00:01:19,230
Back in town, Xijin Bridge stretches across the Yongkang River.

13
00:01:19,540 --> 00:01:25,508
Its covered walkway and timber structure offer
a quieter view of the city and its history.

14
00:01:26,168 --> 00:01:33,892
Across Yongkang's historic villages, ancestral halls
preserve family memories and local craftsmanship.

15
00:01:34,552 --> 00:01:42,354
Traditional celebrations, including the Fangyan
Temple Fair, keep parts of that shared culture alive.

16
00:01:43,014 --> 00:01:50,224
There is also something to taste: roumaibing, a savory
local flatbread with pork and preserved vegetables.

17
00:01:50,884 --> 00:01:54,727
Yongkang is more than a place that makes things.

18
00:01:55,037 --> 00:02:01,922
It is a place where useful objects, living
traditions, and distinctive landscapes come together.

19
00:02:02,232 --> 00:02:05,831
That is a different side of Zhejiang worth getting to know.
